<title>USA: Sterling House adopts rights plan.</title>
<headline>Sterling House adopts rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling House Corp, a long-term-care provider, said Wednesday its board of directors had adopted a shareholder rights plan.</p>
<p>The company said it was not aware of any effort to acquire control of the company.</p>
</text>
